        "original_id": "eb8f0dba-116e-5ee7-b62a-4a9da1a33226",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Pomeranian, Sporting Lucas Terrier, Japanese Spitz\n- Concepts: Spitz type, terrier type, breed size standards\n- Places: Pomerania, Germany, Poland, Central Europe\n\nFacts:\n- The Pomeranian is a breed of dog of the Spitz type.\n- The Pomeranian is often known as a Pom or Pom Pom.\n- The Pomeranian is named for the Pomerania region in Germany and Poland in Central Europe.\n- The Sporting Lucas Terrier is a small breed of dog of the terrier type.\n- The Japanese Spitz has varying ideal size standards around the world.\n- The Japanese Spitz is always larger than the smaller Pomeranian.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
